Requires:       tex(xkeyval.sty)

%description -n texlive-achemso
The bundle provides a BibTeX style file following the requirements of the
American Chemical Society (ACS), and a package to pass settings to the BibTeX
style. It also includes a class which was used for submission support in the
past. All of this material is largely of historical interest and is retained
for stability. For new material, the chem-acs style is available for
bibliographies, and a short template for the ACS website is better suited to
submission.

%package -n texlive-acro
Summary:        Typeset acronyms
Version:        svn77682
