This package ensures that all acronyms used in the text are spelled out in full
at least once. It also provides an environment to build a list of acronyms
used. The package is compatible with pdf bookmarks. The package requires the
suffix package, which in turn requires that it runs under e-TeX.

%package -n texlive-acroterm
Summary:        Manage and index acronyms and terms
Version:        svn61719
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
