%description -n texlive-alterqcm
The alterqcm package is a LaTeX2e package, for making multiple choices
questionnaires in a table with two columns. The aim is to provide some useful
macros to build QCM in tables. These macros may be used by only LaTeX TeX
users. The package works with utf8, pdfLaTeX, LuaLaTeX and XeLaTeX (with some
languages). The documentation is in English.

%package -n texlive-altfont
Summary:        Alternative font handling in LaTeX
Version:        svn15878
License:        GPL-2.0-or-later
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-altfont-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-altfont-doc <= 11:%{version}
