attribute settings are controlled by setting key values. The package makes use
of the everypage package, and uses pgf/tikz for attribute control.

%package -n texlive-bankstatement
Summary:        A LaTeX class for bank statements based on csv data
Version:        svn75301
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
