Requires:       tex(xparse.sty)
Requires:       tex(xspace.sty)

%description -n texlive-chet
The package aims to streamline the work of typesetting, and to provide the look
and feel of harvmac for readers. The package name stands for "Class for High
Energy Theory", as the majority of individuals using harvmac for their papers
were primarily working in high energy theory, a subfield of theoretical
physics.

%package -n texlive-chextras
Summary:        A companion package for the Swiss typesetter
Version:        svn27118
