%description -n texlive-cistercian
A TikZ-based package to display cistercian numerals. After loading the package,
the macro \cistercian{<number>} can be used to display cistercian numerals. The
numerals can be customised via TikZ options.

%package -n texlive-classics
Summary:        Cite classic works
Version:        svn76924
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-classics-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-classics-doc <= 11:%{version}
Requires:       tex(xparse.sty)

%description -n texlive-classics
The package provides a basic framework to cite classic works (specially from
authors such as Homer, Plato, Aristotle, Descartes, Hume, and Kant) in
accordance with traditional pagination systems. It may be used in conjunction
with other citation packages.

%package -n texlive-classpack
Summary:        XML mastering for LaTeX classes and packages
Version:        svn55218
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-classpack-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-classpack-doc <= 11:%{version}
