%package -n texlive-clock
Summary:        Graphical and textual clocks for TeX and LaTeX
Version:        svn15878
License:        GPL-1.0-or-later
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-clock-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-clock-doc <= 11:%{version}

%description -n texlive-clock
Features graphical clocks (with a classical 12h dial and two hands) and text
clocks (in 24h format) which can show system time or any time the user desires.
Works with both TeX and LaTeX. The clock faces (appearances of the dial) are
easily expandable; the default uses a custom Metafont font.

%package -n texlive-clrdblpg
Summary:        Control pagestyle of pages left blank by \cleardoublepage
Version:        svn47511
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
