%description -n texlive-clrstrip
This lightweight package provides the colorstrip environment, that places its
contents into a full page width colour strip.

%package -n texlive-cmdstring
Summary:        Get command name reliably
Version:        svn15878
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-cmdstring-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-cmdstring-doc <= 11:%{version}

%description -n texlive-cmdstring
Extracts the letters of a command's name (e.g., foo for command \foo), in a
