"en-FullText", "en-FULLTEXT", and the additional time style "en-Fulltext". (The
date equivalent can be obtained through commands like \Today.) Unlike the base
styles provided by datetime2.sty, these styles aren't expandable styles. This
means that you can't use the date or time in PDF bookmarks or in the argument
of certain commands, such as \MakeUppercase, while these styles are in use.

