%description -n texlive-dbshow
The package provides four core functions: data storage and display data
filtering data sorting data display All data is saved once and then you can
display these data with custom filters, orders and styles. The package can be
used, for example, to record and display something you'd like to review, maybe
the question you always answered incorrectly or some forgettable knowledge. But
obviously, the package is much more powerful and extensible for more
interesting tasks depending on the individual.

