%description -n texlive-easyformat
This package allows the use of underscores and circumflexes to begin resp. end
italic, bold or SMALLCAPS formatting, as an alternative to the standard LaTeX
\textit{...}, \textbf{...} and/or \textsc{...}. The meaning of underscore and
circumflex in mathmode remain the same.

%package -n texlive-easylist
Summary:        Lists using a single active character
Version:        svn77682
