%description -n texlive-econlipsum
This package is a blind text generator that outputs sentences inferred from
abstracts of economic articles. All the paragraphs are taken with permission
from https://ipsum.mwt.me/.

%package -n texlive-ecv
Summary:        A fancy Curriculum Vitae class
Version:        svn24928
