%description -n texlive-ecv
The class provides an environment for creating a fancily laid out tabular
curriculum vitae inspired by the european curriculum vitae. The distribution
comes with a German and an English template.

%package -n texlive-ed
Summary:        Editorial Notes for LaTeX documents
Version:        svn25231
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-ed-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-ed-doc <= 11:%{version}
