Requires:       tex(xkeyval.sty)

%description -n texlive-framedsyntax
When creating new packages or user guides, it is necessary to describe their
syntax. This package helps by creating coloured frames with rounded corners,
with a coloured background containing the coloured syntax text.

%package -n texlive-frankenstein
Summary:        A collection of LaTeX packages
Version:        svn15878
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
