For several reasons a \caption may be desirable at the top of a table
environment. This package changes the table environment such that
\abovecaptionskip and \belowcaptionskip are swapped. The package should also
work with a non-standard table environment.

%package -n texlive-ftnxtra
Summary:        Extend the applicability of the \footnote command
