%description -n texlive-getfiledate
The package fetches from the system the date of last modification or opening of
an existing file, using the function \pdffilemoddate (present in recent
versions of pdfTeX); the user may specify how the date is to be presented.

%package -n texlive-getitems
Summary:        Gathering items from a list-like environment
Version:        svn39365
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
