Requires:       tex(etoolbox.sty)
Requires:       tex(kvoptions.sty)

%description -n texlive-gitlog
This package allows git change log history to be incorporated into LaTeX
documents; the log data is obtained from the git distributed version control
system. The current release (0.0.beta) is a proof-of-concept release to allow
users an early evaluation and to attract ideas and support. Requests and
suggestions, as well as code contributions are welcome.

%package -n texlive-gitstatus
Summary:        Include Git information in the document as watermark or via variables
Version:        svn64662
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Requires:       tex(catchfile.sty)
