Requires:       tex(forloop.sty)
Requires:       tex(ifthen.sty)
Requires:       tex(xkeyval.sty)

%description -n texlive-grid-system
The package provides the means for LaTeX to implement a grid system as known
from CSS grid systems. The facility is useful for creating box layouts as used
in brochures.

%package -n texlive-gridpapers
Summary:        Graph paper backgrounds and color schemes
Version:        svn58723
License:        LPPL-1.3c
