This package allows creating free form slides with blocks placed on a grid. The
blocks can be filled with text, equations, figures etc. The resulting slides
are similar to the ones produced with LaTeX beamer, but more flexible.
Sequential unconvering of elements is supported. A compiler script is provided
which compiles each slide separately, this way avoiding long compile times.

