of various kinds, ranging from 'large' operators to extensible arrow-like
relations and growing arrow-like math accents that all draw from the classic
Halloween-related iconography (pumpkins, witches, ghosts, cats, and so on)
while being, at the same time, seamlessly integrated within the rest of the
mathematics produced by (AmS-)LaTeX.

