This package writes data to file using Python literal syntax. The data may be
loaded safely in Python using the ast.literal_eval() function or the
latex2pydata Python package. The data can also be hashed within LaTeX
(mdfivesum) so that it is possible to check for the existence of external
cached content generated with the data.

%package -n texlive-latexcolors
Summary:        Use color definitions from latexcolor.com
