Built on top of the xcolor package, the latexcolors package defines the set of
colors shown on latexcolor.com for use in documents typeset with LaTeX &
friends.

%package -n texlive-latexdemo
Summary:        Demonstrate LaTeX code with its resulting output
Version:        svn67201
