%description -n texlive-leftindex
This package provides commands for typesetting left indices. Unlike other
similar packages, leftindex also indents the left superscript, providing much
better spacing in general.

%package -n texlive-leipzig
Summary:        Typeset and index linguistic gloss abbreviations
Version:        svn52450
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
