%description -n texlive-leipzig
The leipzig package provides a set of macros for standard glossing
abbreviations, with options to create new ones. They are mnemonic (e.g. \Acc{}
for accusative, abbreviated acc). These abbre can be used alone or on top of
the glossaries package for easy indexing and glossary printing.

%package -n texlive-lengthconvert
Summary:        Express lengths in arbitrary units
Version:        svn76924
License:        LPPL-1.3c
