%description -n texlive-listparskip
This package modifies list environments such that they add \parskip and
\partopsep before or after a list if and only if the environment follows or
precedes, respectively, a blank line (i.e. a \par).

%package -n texlive-litetable
Summary:        Class schedules with colorful course blocks
