%description -n texlive-locality
A toolbox of macros designed to allow the LaTeX programmer to work around some
of the restrictions of the TeX grouping mechanisms. The present release offers
a preliminary view of the package; not all of its facilities are working
optimally

%package -n texlive-logbox
Summary:        E-TeX showbox facilities for exploration purposes
Version:        svn24499
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
