%description -n texlive-metalogox
This package extends the metalogo package to automatically adjust the
appearance of the logos TeX, LaTeX, LaTeX2e, XeLaTeX, and LuaLaTeX, depending
on the font detected or the option given to metalogox. Most of the serif and
sans fonts listed at The LaTeX Font Catalogue are supported. The package also
supports the hologo and hvlogos packages.

