%description -n texlive-minorrevision
The package supports those who publish articles in peer-reviewed journals. In
the final stages of the review process, the authors typically have to provide
an additional document (such as a letter to the editors), in which they provide
a list of modifications that they made to the manuscript. The package
automatically provides line numbers and quotations from the manuscript, for
this letter. The package loads the package lineno, so (in effect) shares
