Requires:       tex(coseoul.sty)
Requires:       tex(ifthen.sty)
Requires:       tex(import.sty)

%description -n texlive-modular
LaTeX sections have absolute depth, e.g. \section, \subsection, etc. When
composing modular documents, we want relative depths. The coseoul package
provides relative headings, but does not get things right when composing a
document modularly from multiple parts. This package provides the missing
piece. modular relies on coseoul, import, and ifthen.

%package -n texlive-moloch
Summary:        Beamer theme based on Metropolis
Version:        svn77913
