%description -n texlive-movie15
The package provides an interface to embed movies, sounds and 3D objects into
PDF documents for use with LaTeX as well as pdfLaTeX. The package defines a
command \includemovie with PDF-1.5 compatibility. Option 'autoplay' causes the
media clip to be started right after the page has loaded. This is useful for
side by side movie clips to be played back synchronously. The package is now
superseded by media9

%package -n texlive-mparhack
