and want to draw Message Sequence Charts in their texts. The package is not an
MSC editor; it simply takes a textual description of an MSC and draws the
corresponding MSC. The current version of the MSC macro package supports the
full MSC2000 language.

%package -n texlive-msg
Summary:        A package for LaTeX localisation
Version:        svn49578
