The package is designed to localise any document class or package. This should
be very useful for end-users who could obtain messages in their own preferred
language. It is really easy to use by writers of other classes and packages.
Volunteers are urged to test the package, report, and even to localise the
message file to their own language. Documentation is provided in English.

%package -n texlive-mslapa
