with the multicol package, hence its name, but also supports the twocolumn
option and \twocolumn macro provided by the standard classes (and related
classes such as the KOMA-Script equivalents). The package depends on expl3 and
xparse.

%package -n texlive-multidef
Summary:        Quickly define several similar macros
Version:        svn40637
