%package -n texlive-multiexpand
Summary:        Variations on the primitive command \expandafter
Version:        svn77682
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-multiexpand-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-multiexpand-doc <= 11:%{version}

%description -n texlive-multiexpand
The package provides two user commands; one that performs multiple expansions,
and one that does multiple \expandafter operations, in a single macro call. The
author suggests that the same effect could be provided by use of the command
variant mechanisms of LaTeX 3 (see, for example, the interface documentation of
