Requires:       tex(babel.sty)
Requires:       tex(caption.sty)
Requires:       tex(comment.sty)
Requires:       tex(etoolbox.sty)
Requires:       tex(float.sty)
Requires:       tex(graphicx.sty)
Requires:       tex(paracol.sty)
Requires:       tex(setspace.sty)
Requires:       tex(tcolorbox.sty)
Requires:       tex(tikz.sty)
Requires:       tex(titling.sty)
Requires:       tex(translations.sty)
Requires:       tex(trimspaces.sty)
Requires:       tex(xifthen.sty)
Requires:       tex(xparse.sty)
Requires:       tex(xspace.sty)
Requires:       tex(xstring.sty)

%description -n texlive-multinotes
This package provides tools for typesetting multilingual lecture notes,
exercise sheets, and general-purpose documents. Each language is specified via
its corresponding babel identifier and is associated with a declaration, macro,
and environment used to delimit content written in that language. Arbitrary
combinations of languages can be loaded in a single document to support both
monolingual and multilingual output. The package also defines macros and
environments for typesetting lecture notes and exercise sheets, including
configurable inclusion of elements such as proofs, solutions, and sketchboxes.

%package -n texlive-multiple-choice
Summary:        LaTeX package for multiple-choice questions
