Requires:       tex(fontawesome.sty)
Requires:       tex(fontenc.sty)
Requires:       tex(fontspec.sty)
Requires:       tex(glossaries-extra.sty)
Requires:       tex(hologo.sty)
Requires:       tex(hyperref.sty)
Requires:       tex(iftex.sty)
Requires:       tex(mfirstuc.sty)
Requires:       tex(pifont.sty)
Requires:       tex(scrhack.sty)
Requires:       tex(scrlayer-scrpage.sty)
Requires:       tex(tcolorbox.sty)
Requires:       tex(textcomp.sty)
Requires:       tex(tikz.sty)
Requires:       tex(twemojis.sty)
Requires:       tex(upquote.sty)
Requires:       tex(varioref.sty)
Requires:       tex(xcolor.sty)
Requires:       tex(xr-hyper.sty)

%description -n texlive-nlctdoc
The class provides support for the documentation of the author's packages,
using koma-script. This class is provided "as is" solely for the benefit of
anyone who wants to compile the documentation of those packages.

%package -n texlive-noconflict
Summary:        Resolve macro name conflict between packages
Version:        svn30140
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-noconflict-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-noconflict-doc <= 11:%{version}

%description -n texlive-noconflict
The package provides several commands to prefix (and hence obscure) a macro's
(or a sequence of macros') name, and to restore the original macro(s) at places
in a document where they are needed.

%package -n texlive-nodepthtext
Summary:        Change small texts to remove the depth of the letters
Version:        svn73069
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Requires:       tex(calc.sty)
Requires:       tex(graphicx.sty)
Requires:       tex(xstring.sty)

%description -n texlive-nodepthtext
Modify small texts in order to remove depth of letters (for small texts), with
automatic raising/scaling.

%package -n texlive-noindentafter
Summary:        Prevent paragraph indentation after environments or macros
Version:        svn59195
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-noindentafter-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-noindentafter-doc <= 11:%{version}
Requires:       tex(etoolbox.sty)
Requires:       tex(xpatch.sty)

%description -n texlive-noindentafter
The package, as the name suggests, supplies tools to automatically suppress
indentations in following paragraphs, specifically those following a particular
macro or environment.

%package -n texlive-noitcrul
Summary:        Improved underlines in mathematics
Version:        svn77682
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-noitcrul-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-noitcrul-doc <= 11:%{version}
Requires:       tex(robustcommand.sty)

%description -n texlive-noitcrul
The package provides a (maths mode) \underline variant which doesn't impose
italics correction at the end.

%package -n texlive-nolbreaks
Summary:        No line breaks in text
Version:        svn77682
License:        LicenseRef-Fedora-Public-Domain
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-nolbreaks-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-nolbreaks-doc <= 11:%{version}

%description -n texlive-nolbreaks
Use \nolbreaks{some text} to prevent line breaks in "some text". This has the
advantage over \mbox{} that glue (rubber space) remains flexible. Most common
cases are handled here (\linebreak is disabled, for example) but spaces hidden
in macros or { } can still create break-points.

%package -n texlive-nomencl
Summary:        Produce lists of symbols as in nomenclature
Version:        svn77682
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-nomencl-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-nomencl-doc <= 11:%{version}
Requires:       tex(array.sty)
Requires:       tex(ifthen.sty)
Requires:       tex(longtable.sty)
Requires:       tex(siunitx.sty)
Requires:       tex(tocbasic.sty)
Requires:       tex(xkeyval.sty)

%description -n texlive-nomencl
Produces lists of symbols using the capabilities of the MakeIndex program.

%package -n texlive-nomentbl
Summary:        Nomenclature typeset in a longtable
Version:        svn16549
