%package -n texlive-notoccite
Summary:        Prevent trouble from citations in table of contents, etc.
Version:        svn77682
License:        LicenseRef-Fedora-Public-Domain
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-notoccite-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-notoccite-doc <= 11:%{version}

%description -n texlive-notoccite
If you have \cite commands in \section-like commands, or in \caption, the
citation will also appear in the table of contents, or list of whatever. If you
are also using an unsrt-like bibliography style, these citations will come at
the very start of the bibliography, which is confusing. This package suppresses
the effect.

%package -n texlive-novabeamer-theme
Summary:        A flexible and customizable LaTeX theme for creating professional presentations
Version:        svn76924
