%description -n texlive-numspell
This package supports the spelling of cardinal and ordinal numbers. Supported
languages are English, French, German, Hungarian, Italian, and Latin. The
package requires xstring and iflang.

%package -n texlive-ocg-p
Summary:        PDF OCG support in LaTeX
Version:        svn28803
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-ocg-p-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
