%description -n texlive-parsa
A package for preparing dissertations and theses for Iranian universities as
fast and as efficiently as possible. The package depends on xparse, fancyhdr,
graphicx, multirow, float, and adjustbox.

%package -n texlive-parselines
Summary:        Apply a macro to each line of an environment
Version:        svn21475
License:        LPPL-1.3c
