Obsoletes:      texlive-parselines-doc <= 11:%{version}

%description -n texlive-parselines
The package defines an environment "parse lines" which processes each line of
an environment with a macro. An example of shading the lines of an environment
is given.

%package -n texlive-pas-cours
Summary:        Macros useful in preparing teaching material
Version:        svn55859
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
