Creating pdfs with pdfLaTeX populates several pdf meta-data fields such as
date/time of creation/modification, information about the LaTeX installation
(e.g., pdfTeX version), and the relative paths of included pdfs. The pdfprivacy
package provides support for emptying several of these pdf meta-data fields as
well as suppressing some pdfTeX meta-data entries in the resulting pdf.

