%description -n texlive-photo
This package introduces a new float type called photo which works similar to
the float types table and figure. Various options exist for placing photos,
captions, and a "photographer" line. In twocolumn documents, a possibility
exists to generate double-column floats automatically if the photo does not fit
into one column. Photos do not have to be placed as floats, they can also be
placed as boxes, with captions and photographer line still being available.

%package -n texlive-photobook
Summary:        A document class for typesetting photo books
