Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Requires:       tex(calc.sty)

%description -n texlive-picture
There are macro and environment arguments that expect numbers that will
internally be multiplied by \unitlength. This package extends the syntax of
these arguments, so that dimensions with calculation support may be used for
these arguments.

%package -n texlive-piff
Summary:        Macro tools by Mike Piff
Version:        svn21894
License:        LicenseRef-Fedora-Public-Domain
