Obsoletes:      texlive-piff-doc <= 11:%{version}
Requires:       tex(amsfonts.sty)

%description -n texlive-piff
The set (now) consists of: a small package for dealing with duplicate-numbered
output pages; newproof, for defining mathematical proof structures; onepagem
for omitting the page number in one-page documents and time, which prints a
12-hour format time.

%package -n texlive-pkginfograb
Summary:        Collect LaTeX package information in a regular way
Version:        svn77338
License:        LPPL-1.3c OR AGPL-3.0-or-later
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea

%description -n texlive-pkginfograb
This package is aimed at package writers and offers a way to collect/document
LaTeX package information (name, version, description, etc.) in a systematic
way.

%package -n texlive-pkgloader
Summary:        Manage the options and loading order of other packages
Version:        svn76924
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-pkgloader-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-pkgloader-doc <= 11:%{version}
