This package lets you typeset justified sequences, also called pointing
strings. It's used for instance, in research papers about Game Semantics to
represent sequence of game moves with their associated justification pointers.
Depending on wether using LaTeX or pdfLaTeX, the package uses PSTricks and
pst-node respectively pgf/TikZ.

%package -n texlive-pxgreeks
Summary:        Shape selection for PX fonts Greek letters
Version:        svn21838
