%description -n texlive-pynotebook
This package provides environments to (re)create a jupyter notebook with: raw
blocks; markdown blocks (with full LaTeX support); code blocks (python) with
execution thanks to piton and PyLuaTeX (version > 0.7.0).

%package -n texlive-python
Summary:        Embed Python code in LaTeX
