Obsoletes:      texlive-quotmark-doc <= 11:%{version}

%description -n texlive-quotmark
The package provides a means of ensuring consistent quote marks throughout your
document. The style can be changed either via package option or command, and
the package detects language selections (from the babel or ngerman packages),
and uses the punctuation marks appropriate for the current language. The author
now considers the package obsolete, and recommends use of csquotes in its
place.

%package -n texlive-rainbowbrackets
