of tokens. Two mechanisms for defining chunks are provided: the \ranToks
command accepts an argument containing tokens to be randomised; and the
\bRTVToks/\eRTVToks commands delimit a collection of tokens for randomising;
each group inside a rtVw constitutes one of these (typically larger) token
sets.

