The terminalcode package provides authentic terminal-style code display
environments for LaTeX documents. It features UTF-8 box-drawing characters,
comprehensive ANSI 16-color support with dynamic dark and light themes, and
seamless integration with external code files. Requires LuaLaTeX or XeLaTeX.

%package -n texlive-termlist
Summary:        Label any kind of term with a continuous counter
Version:        svn18923
