%description -n texlive-ticket
Provides an easy to handle interface to produce visiting cards, labels for your
files, stickers, pins and other stuff for your office, conferences etc. All you
need is a definition of your 'ticket' included in a ticket definition file and
the two commands \ticketdefault and \ticket.

%package -n texlive-timeop
Summary:        Calculates and displays arithmetic operations with durations
Version:        svn75112
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
