Requires:       tex(keyval.sty)

%description -n texlive-typogrid
Draws a grid on every page of the document; the grid divides the page into
columns, and may be used for fixing measurements of layout.

%package -n texlive-uassign
Summary:        Environments and options for typesetting university assignments
Version:        svn38459
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
