Requires:       tex(titlesec.sty)

%description -n texlive-uassign
The purpose of this package is to provide simple question and solution style
environments for typesetting university assignments.

%package -n texlive-ucs
Summary:        Extended UTF-8 input encoding support for LaTeX
Version:        svn78101
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
Provides:       texlive-ucs-doc = %{epoch}:%{version}-%{release}
Obsoletes:      texlive-ucs-doc <= 11:%{version}
