This package loads url by default and defines possible URL breaks for all
alphanumerical characters, as well as = / . : * - ~ ' " All arguments which are
valid for url can be used and will be passed on to this package. For more
information read the documentation of url itself.

%package -n texlive-xwatermark
Summary:        Graphics and text watermarks on selected pages
Version:        svn61719
License:        LPPL-1.3c
Requires:       texlive-base
Requires:       texlive-kpathsea
